{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-09-30 05:56:00', 'title': 'OLUMIANT® SIGNIFICANTLY IMPROVED HAIR REGROWTH TO AT LEAST 80% SCALP COVERAGE AS EARLY AS 24 WEEKS ACROSS FIRST COMPLETED PHASE 3 STUDIES FOR ALOPECIA AREATA', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, SEPT. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) AND INCYTE (NASDAQ: INCY) ANNOUNCED TODAY DETAILED RESULTS FROM TWO PIVOTAL PHASE 3 TRIALS (BRAVE-AA1 AND BRAVE-AA2), WHICH FOUND ONCE-DAILY OLUMIANT® (BARICITINIB) 4-MG WAS SUPERIOR TO PLACEBO IN ACHIEVING SIGNIFICANT SCALP HAIR REGROWTH AS EARLY AS 24 WEEKS IN ADULTS WITH SEVERE ALOPECIA AREATA (AA) AS DEFINED BY ≥50% SCALP HAIR LOSS AT BASELINE.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-09-30 04:40:00', 'title': "LILLY'S TIRZEPATIDE LED TO GREATER IMPROVEMENTS IN LIVER FAT CONTENT COMPARED TO INSULIN DEGLUDEC IN ADULTS WITH TYPE 2 DIABETES IN SURPASS-3 MRI SUB-STUDY", 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, SEPT. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TIRZEPATIDE LED TO GREATER IMPROVEMENTS IN LIVER FAT CONTENT AND ABDOMINAL ADIPOSE TISSUE\xa0COMPARED TO TITRATED INSULIN DEGLUDEC IN ADULTS WITH TYPE 2 DIABETES IN AN MRI SUB-STUDY OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY'S\xa0(NYSE: LLY) PHASE 3 SURPASS-3 CLINICAL TRIAL.1 THE RESULTS WERE PRESENTED TODAY AT THE 57TH EUROPEAN ASSOCIATION FOR THE STUDY OF DIABETES (EASD) ANNUAL MEETING IN AN EASD-SPONSORED SYMPOSIUM."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-09-30 04:30:00', 'title': "LILLY'S TIRZEPATIDE LED TO GREATER TIME IN RANGE COMPARED TO INSULIN DEGLUDEC IN ADULTS WITH TYPE 2 DIABETES IN SURPASS-3 CGM SUB-STUDY", 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, SEPT. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALL THREE TIRZEPATIDE DOSES LED TO MORE TIME IN TIGHT TARGET RANGE (71-140 MG/DL),\xa0IMPROVED GLYCEMIC VARIABILITY AND NUMERICALLY LESS TIME IN HYPOGLYCEMIA COMPARED TO TITRATED INSULIN DEGLUDEC IN ADULTS WITH TYPE 2 DIABETES IN A CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING (CGM) SUB-STUDY1 OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY'S\xa0(NYSE: LLY) PHASE 3 SURPASS-3 CLINICAL TRIAL."}